{
  "id": "r01-l04",
  "unit": "r01-signs",
  "title": "Caution",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "Warning signs start with a heading: **বিপদ!** 'Danger!' or **সাবধান!** 'Caution!'. Then comes the instruction: **স্পর্শ করবেন না** 'do not touch' (speech: ধরবেন না), **দূরে থাকুন** 'keep away'.\n\n**অগ্নি** is the formal word for **আগুন** 'fire'; you meet it in **অগ্নি নিরাপত্তা** 'fire safety'.\n\n**Conjuncts:** **জ্জ** is a held j (**বিপজ্জনক** *bipojjonok*); **দ্য** doubles the d (**বৈদ্যুতিক** *boiddutik*); **ত্ত** is a held t (**নিরাপত্তা**). **স্প** = স + প, and **র্শ** has a ref: **স্পর্শ** *sporsho*.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "shabdhan",
      "bn": "সাবধান",
      "tr": "shabdhan",
      "en": "careful!; beware",
      "notes": "Register: formal; also heard in speech. Heard in speech too; on signs it is the heading 'Caution!'."
    },
    {
      "id": "shotorko",
      "bn": "সতর্ক",
      "tr": "shotorko",
      "en": "alert; careful",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: সাবধান. সতর্ক থাকুন 'stay alert'. র্ক = ref on ক."
    },
    {
      "id": "thakun",
      "bn": "থাকুন",
      "tr": "thakun",
      "en": "please stay; please be (standard)",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: থাকেন. -উন command: দূরে থাকুন 'keep away'."
    },
    {
      "id": "bipod",
      "bn": "বিপদ",
      "tr": "bipod",
      "en": "danger",
      "notes": "Register: formal; also heard in speech. Sign heading 'Danger!'; also everyday 'trouble'."
    },
    {
      "id": "bipojjonok",
      "bn": "বিপজ্জনক",
      "tr": "bipojjonok",
      "en": "dangerous",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). জ্জ = a held j: bi-poj-jo-nok."
    },
    {
      "id": "boiddutik",
      "bn": "বৈদ্যুতিক",
      "tr": "boiddutik",
      "en": "electrical; electric",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). দ্য doubles the d: boid-du-tik."
    },
    {
      "id": "sporsho",
      "bn": "স্পর্শ",
      "tr": "sporsho",
      "en": "touch",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: ধরা. স্পর্শ করবেন না 'do not touch'. স্প (স + প), then র্শ (ref on শ)."
    },
    {
      "id": "ogni",
      "bn": "অগ্নি",
      "tr": "ogni",
      "en": "fire (formal)",
      "notes": "Register: formal (written). Everyday word: আগুন. অগ্নি নিরাপত্তা 'fire safety'. গ্ন = গ + ন."
    },
    {
      "id": "nirapod",
      "bn": "নিরাপদ",
      "tr": "nirapod",
      "en": "safe",
      "notes": "Register: formal; also heard in speech."
    },
    {
      "id": "nirapotta",
      "bn": "নিরাপত্তা",
      "tr": "nirapotta",
      "en": "safety; security",
      "notes": "Register: formal; also heard in speech. ত্ত = a held t."
    }
  ],
